msgid "I used to pay 100 gold for a week of work. Then the robbers under the bridge took every job in town and paid themselves. There's nothing left for honest hands."
msgstr "我以前一周工钱给一百金币。后来桥下的强盗把镇上的活全包了，还自己给自己发工钱。老实人什么都没剩下。"

msgid "This Phirna plant has been dug up already. It will grow back in time."
msgstr "这株菲尔娜植物已经被挖过了，过一阵会重新长出来。"

msgid "The skull spits out three scrolls of Mind Blast. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出三卷心灵冲击卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

msgid "\"Feed me!\" the skull demands, and clacks its jaw. 'Three scrolls of Mind Blast for it, dearie. One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "“喂我！”头骨要求道，咔嗒咔嗒地动着下颚。“换三卷心灵冲击卷轴，亲爱的。一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"

msgid "The skull spits out three scrolls of Heal. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出三卷治疗卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

msgid "The skull clacks its jaw. 'Three scrolls of Heal, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "头骨咔嗒动着下颚。“三卷治疗卷轴吗，亲爱的？一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"

msgid "The skull spits out three scrolls of Sparks. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出三卷火花卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

msgid "The skull clacks its jaw. 'Three scrolls of Sparks, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "头骨咔嗒动着下颚。“三卷火花卷轴吗，亲爱的？一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"
